# ─────────────────────── Agent harnesses ─────────────
# Committed (team-shared, no secrets or personal model/theme prefs):
# .pi/settings.json, .pi/{extensions,skills,prompts,themes,agents}/,
# .pi/subagents.json, .pi/agent-memory/, .pi/workflows/settings.json,
# .mcp.json, .pi/mcp.json (team overrides only; /mcp enable|disable writes here),
# .rtk/filters.toml. Ponytail and rtk otherwise keep state outside the repo.
.pi/npm/
.pi/git/
.pi/worktrees/
.pi/workflows/runs/
.pi/agent-memory-local/
.superpowers/
.worktrees/
